---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service - BiliExtract"
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for the BiliExtract online media extraction utility."
  canonical="https://biliextract.me/legal/terms-of-service/"
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="card legal-card">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="updated-date">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

        <section>
          <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and utilizing BiliExtract ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
            If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue use of the Service immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Permitted Personal Use</h2>
          <p>
            BiliExtract is provided strictly for personal, non-commercial, and archival fair use. You are solely responsible for ensuring
            that your downloading of any public media complies with applicable local laws, fair-use provisions, and intellectual property statutes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
          <p>
            BiliExtract does not host, store, duplicate, or maintain copies of any multimedia files, streams, or databases on its servers.
            All video, audio, and subtitle streams resolved by the tool originate directly from third-party networks and Bilibili content delivery networks.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            The Service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind.
            Under no circumstances shall BiliExtract or its operators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of this utility.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 60px 0 80px;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .legal-card {
    padding: 48px;
  }
  .legal-card h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .updated-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .legal-card section {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .legal-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
